{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01VaDRm2tX9Cm5oaHvpHp5z8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XkHMnJeaauABmsCBCFrYbJ","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/root/tank-simulation/.ralph/projects/tank-sim/loops/002-source-water-mixing-and-geometry-driven-thermal/20260315042500-impl-response-001.md","content":"# Implementation Response (Iteration 1)\n\n## Changes Made\n1. **Water-change profile validation (required):** Added `SourceWaterProfile::validate(profile_id)` method in `crates/tank_core/src/types/source_water.rs` that rejects non-finite or negative chemistry values and non-finite/non-positive temperature. Added `SimError::InvalidSourceProfile { id, field, value }` variant in `crates/tank_core/src/types/actions.rs`. Updated `validate_water_changes` in `crates/tank_core/src/systems/water_change.rs` to call `profile.validate()` on every resolved profile before any mutations occur. This ensures that both unknown and invalid resolved profiles are caught atomically before `step_one_hour` processes any actions, preserving the partial-failure invariant: `TankState`, queued actions, RNG state, clock, and event log remain exactly unchanged on failure.\n\n2. **Invariant hardening:** Updated `check_non_negative` in `crates/tank_core/src/invariants.rs` to also reject non-finite (`NaN`, `Inf`) values, preventing NaN propagation through the simulation state even outside the water-change path.\n\n3. **Strict preset enum validation (recommended):** Changed `crates/tank_scenarios/src/lib.rs` to return `PresetError::Validation` instead of silently defaulting to `InertSand`/`FastStem` when encountering unsupported substrate kind or plant guild strings.\n\n4. **Regression tests:** Added two new tests in `crates/tank_core/tests/water_change_mass_balance.rs`:\n   - `invalid_resolved_profile_returns_error_and_leaves_state_unchanged` — inserts a profile with `NaN` calcium, queues feed + water change, asserts `InvalidSourceProfile` error and full state immutability (day, hour, event_log, water chemistry, detritus).\n   - `invalid_resolved_profile_negative_chemistry_returns_error` — inserts a profile with negative nitrate, asserts `InvalidSourceProfile` error.\n\n## Could Not Address\nNone\n\n## Pending Changes (Pre-Commit)\n- `crates/tank_core/src/types/source_water.rs` — added `validate()` method, merged `impl` blocks\n- `crates/tank_core/src/types/actions.rs` — added `InvalidSourceProfile` variant to `SimError`\n- `crates/tank_core/src/systems/water_change.rs` — `validate_water_changes` now validates resolved profiles\n- `crates/tank_core/src/invariants.rs` — `check_non_negative` rejects non-finite values\n- `crates/tank_scenarios/src/lib.rs` — substrate/plant guild match arms return errors instead of defaulting\n- `crates/tank_core/tests/water_change_mass_balance.rs` — two new regression tests\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":299,"cache_read_input_tokens":67877,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":299},"output_tokens":25,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c9944199-0c8b-41af-af7d-6829c99add9b","uuid":"ce1e48a1-0153-40de-8f23-a21ba0944899"}
